      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5832 - The Prophet (sw) said; \"There is no obedience to the created (makhlooq) in disobedience to the Creator (Khaliq, the one Allah (swt)).\"\n(Obedience to anyone other than Allah (swt), will not supercede the divine commands of Allah (swt) if it leads to the disobedience of Allah (swt))\n\""
        ]
      }
